  "answer": "I found no earlier ticket in the archive that reports this problem. The archive has no past ticket about `wslc image import` failing with E_INVALIDARG when the target has no tag. The tickets that came up were either about classic `wsl --import` or about other WSLC commands. Until a fix ships, give the target image a tag yourself: `wslc image import alp.tar test:latest` works, as you already found. Please keep this ticket open as a new bug. Docker's `docker image import alp.tar test` defaults to `:latest`, so `wslc` should do the same. Include the diagnostic logs you attached."
 },
